WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.000
-Guys, finally, we have
exactly eight shows left

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.767
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:06.801
for the beloved
"Tonight Show" tradition.

00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:09.801
It is time for "12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:10.934
Here we go.

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:13.000
-♪ 12 days
of Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.834
♪ Eight days left ♪

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.000
-That's right.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.434
Every show
between now and Christmas,

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.801
we'll be giving
one lucky audience member

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:26.634
a heavenly Christmas sweater

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:28.434
from the "countdown
to Christmas" cabinet.

00:00:28.434 --> 00:00:30.200
Since there are
eight shows left,

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.901
let's open door number eight,
shall we?

00:00:32.901 --> 00:00:33.968
Hello.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:36.200
This is it right here.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.734
I'm very excited about this one.
-It's a good one.

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:39.334
-Last one was hard to top.

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:41.734
The last one, we had someone's
head coming through a chimney.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:42.834
-Exactly.
-Yeah. Here we go.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.067
Let's see what we have tonight,
yeah.

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:47.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:52.968
♪♪

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.234
Heavy.

00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:56.300
It's got some weight to it.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.501
Yeah.

00:00:58.501 --> 00:00:59.567
Wow.

00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:01.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.334
Epaulets?

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:12.033
Now let's see who's going home
with tonight's sweater.

00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:12.934
This is a heavy one.

00:01:12.934 --> 00:01:14.534
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:01:14.534 --> 00:01:17.400
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:19.367
Quest, can I get a drum roll,
please?

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.801
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:28.467
284!

00:01:28.467 --> 00:01:36.501
♪♪

00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:44.534
♪♪

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:46.868
Hey. I'm Jimmy.
Nice to see you.

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:48.834
Can you stand over there?

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:50.634
Welcome to the show.
What is your name?

00:01:50.634 --> 00:01:52.701
-Catalina.
-Catalina, where are you from?

00:01:52.701 --> 00:01:54.334
-Portugal.
-Hey!

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:55.634
Come on!

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:57.100
I'm so happy you're here.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.968
-I'm happy, too.

00:01:58.968 --> 00:02:02.434
-This is your color, basically.
-Yeah. It's my favorite color.

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:04.701
-It just happened that pink
is your favorite color?

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:06.467
Do you have anything like this
in Portugal?

00:02:06.467 --> 00:02:07.534
-No.
I'm so happy.

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:08.534
-Yes.

00:02:08.534 --> 00:02:10.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:12.033
Well, you haven't
tried it on yet.

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.100
-I'm sure it's going to be fine.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.834
-Can you -- Can you try it on?

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:17.100
-Yeah, of course.
-Yeah?

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.033
Here you go.
It's got a lot of --

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:23.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.100
No, okay, I can hear you.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:28.267
Catalina, oh.

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:29.734
[ Laughs ]

00:02:29.734 --> 00:02:30.834
Wow.

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:32.667
Get your -- Oh --
You have -- Oh.

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:34.868
Get your hair out.
You look gorgeous.

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:36.934
That's what I'm talking --
Look at that.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.067
That's how you rock the sweater.

00:02:39.067 --> 00:02:40.734
Beautiful!

00:02:40.734 --> 00:02:43.200
One more round of applause
for our winner.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.968
Congratulations.
Thank you for being here.

00:02:44.968 --> 00:02:46.267
Stick around.

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:48.000
We'll be right back with
Michelle Pfeiffer, everybody.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.467
Come on back, now.

